### Scope Contract 5: Product Card — Typography & Structure
**Gap Coverage**: G-04 (Product Card — Typography), G-05 (Add to Cart)

**Current State**: Uses `type-body` for name, `Price` component for price

**Target State**:
- Name: `.type-card-title` (h3 scale, semibold, `letterSpacing: 0.05em`)
- Price: `.type-price` (h4 scale, `text.priceTag`, semibold, `letterSpacing: 0.1em`)
- Add to cart: `.btn-cart` full width below price

**DoD — Pass 1: Skeleton**
- [ ] `ProductCard.tsx`: `article` > `Link` > `figure` + `div` structure
- [ ] Body: `h3` + `p` + `button` semantic order

**DoD — Pass 2: Data**
- [ ] Product data props verified (name, price, image, slug)
- [ ] Cart button action (or placeholder for future)

**DoD — Pass 3: Build (Desktop → Mobile)**

*Layer 1 — Structure*
- [ ] `article` container
- [ ] `figure` for image section
- [ ] `div` for body section
- [ ] `h3` for name, `p` for price, `button` for cart

*Layer 2 — Layout*
- [ ] Card: `.card-product-dark` (from Contract 1)
- [ ] Body: `flex flex-col gap-1 p-4`
- [ ] Cart button: `w-full mt-3`

*Layer 3 — Surface*
- [ ] Name: `.type-card-title` + `text-headline` + `line-clamp-2`
- [ ] Price: `.type-price` + `text-priceTag`
- [ ] Button: `.btn-cart`

*Layer 4 — Interaction*
- [ ] Card hover: shadow + border + translateY (from `.card-product-dark`)
- [ ] Image scale on card hover
- [ ] Cart button active state

**Verification**
```bash
npx playwright test --grep "ProductCard"
npm run build
```

