### Scope Contract 6: Filter Sidebar — Visual System
**Gap Coverage**: G-07 (Visual Separation), G-08 (Width), G-09 (Checkbox Style)

**Current State**: `w-full`, browser-native checkboxes, no section header anchors

**Target State**:
- Width: 240px fixed
- Background: `surface.elevated` with border
- Custom checkboxes: 14×14, `brand.400` checked state
- Section labels with `section-header-anchor` rule

**DoD — Pass 1: Skeleton**
- [ ] `FilterSidebar.tsx`: `aside` > `form` > `fieldset` > `legend` + `div` structure
- [ ] Checkbox: hidden native input + custom div

**DoD — Pass 2: Data**
- [ ] Filter groups and options data flow verified

**DoD — Pass 3: Build (Desktop → Mobile)**

*Layer 1 — Structure*
- [ ] `aside` sidebar container
- [ ] `form` with multiple `fieldset`
- [ ] Each `fieldset`: `legend` + checkbox list
- [ ] Checkbox: hidden `input` + visual `div` sibling

*Layer 2 — Layout*
- [ ] Sidebar: `w-60` (240px) fixed
- [ ] Sticky: `sticky top-desktop-header-h`
- [ ] Padding: `p-6`
- [ ] Sections: `space-y-6`
- [ ] Checkboxes: `flex items-center gap-3`

*Layer 3 — Surface*
- [ ] Container: `bg-surface-elevated` + `border border-border-secondary` + `rounded-sm`
- [ ] Header "FILTERS": `.type-overline` + `text-caption`
- [ ] Section labels: `.type-overline` + `text-accent-500` + `.section-header-anchor`
- [ ] Checkbox unchecked: `w-4 h-4 border border-border-primary rounded-sm`
- [ ] Checkbox checked: `bg-brand-400 border-brand-400` + SVG checkmark
- [ ] Label: `.type-body` + `text-body` color

*Layer 4 — Interaction*
- [ ] Checkbox hover: border → `brand-400`
- [ ] Label hover: `text-primary`
- [ ] Focus ring: `ring-2 ring-brand-600`

**Verification**
```bash
npx playwright test --grep "FilterSidebar"
npm run build
```

