- [ ] Each chip: `button[type="button"]`
- [ ] Clear button: separate `button`

*Layer 2 — Layout*
- [ ] Chip: `inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1`
- [ ] Dismiss icon: inline with label

*Layer 3 — Surface*
