- [ ] Figure with image wrapper

*Layer 2 — Layout*
- [ ] Figure: `aspect-[4/3]` + `overflow-hidden`
- [ ] Grid: `grid-cols-1 xs:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6`

*Layer 3 — Surface*
