## Post-Sprint Lock

**Sprint Complete When:**
1. Build passes: `npm run build` exits 0
2. All Playwright tests pass
3. Homepage regression tests pass (no visual changes)
4. All 10 scope contracts marked done
5. This file updated with completion notes
